		}
		{
			dependencies: ["555F68E8B2E7B8E6"]
			description: ["&7&oAs the Spore infection spreads and matures, it awakens something even more sinister: the Proto Mind Entity. This powerful being emerges after several days of infection, establishing a fortress in its domain. The Proto Mind fortifies the infection's hold on the land, making it even more dangerous.&r&r"]
			hide: true
