			dependencies: ["17B92EC0D6346E8E"]
			description: ["&7&oTo clear the Spore infection completely, you’ll need specialized machinery found in old, abandoned labs scattered around the world. These labs contain the tools necessary to harness a CDU (Cryogenic Dispensing Unit) with ice to cleanse an area fully.&r&o&o&r"]
