		{
			dependencies: ["5463824B3D535B02"]
			description: ["&o&7The Spore infection has a weakness: it doesn’t do well in cold environments. If you’re looking to slow down its spread or create a safer area, head to a snowy biome or any cold region. The icy temperatures will keep the Spore at bay, giving you a better chance to fight back and prepare.&r&r"]
