		{
			dependencies: ["2EA2FBBD4C184764"]
			description: [
				"&7&oAs the Flesh infection spreads, you will receive messages indicating the amount of biomass accumulated, signaling the infection’s growth and evolution through different phases. Each phase represents an increased threat level, requiring more preparation and stronger defenses.&r&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&l胚胎阶段&r - &7&o0 生物质。&r&r"
